 full of trends. The aim is a space that feels calm, useful and personal.",{"children":"Natural textures, warm neutrals and a few carefully chosen pieces often do more than a room full of trends. The aim is a space that feels calm, useful and personal."}],"$L1a","$L1b"]}],"$L1c","$L1d","$L1e"]}],"$L1f"]}]}]}],"$L20","$L21"]
1a:["$","p","Layering is part of the process. Combine smooth surfaces with timber grain, soft textiles and brushed metal, then let lighting add depth throughout the day.",{"children":"Layering is part of the process. Combine smooth surfaces with timber grain, soft textiles and brushed metal, then let lighting add depth throughout the day."}]
1b:["$","p","The result is a home that feels collected rather than staged: relaxed, adaptable and ready for everyday life.",{"children":"The result is a home that feels collected rather than staged: relaxed, adaptable and ready for everyday life."}]
1c:["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"mt-9 border-l-4 border-gold bg-[#F9F1E7] px-6 py-5 text-xl font-medium leading-8 text-black","children":["“","Every room tells a story. A modern home tour in Milan is a reminder that the smallest details often speak the loudest.","”"]}]
